dma.c reads two DMA masks from the port's gba/io_reg.h. The build takes the expansion's
headers, which lack them, so the platform header that dma.c includes defines them.

diff --git a/include/platform/dma.h b/include/platform/dma.h
index 1751518..7cb94e8 100644
